{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>林盛斌（Bob）擁有三名青春可人的女兒，而18歲大女林霏兒（Faye）向來因打扮性感，成為外界討論焦點，更因部分網民無法接受林霏兒打扮及外貌，令林霏兒意外成為該些網民人身攻擊的對象。林盛斌火速護女，希望大家對無辜愛女「高抬貴手」，林霏兒未因外界評論受到影響，繼續展現自信，近日以青春性感形象接下品牌廣告，挑戰性感尺度！</p><figure><img alt=\"林盛斌攜同太太黃乙頤、長女林霏兒（左一）、次女林熹兒（左三）、三女林機兒（左二）及幼子林道申一同在《史迪仔》首映上接受傳媒訪問。（莫匡堯　攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260530/1137407792962080768496250.jpeg/3Oe9sMeNh-FiaVvMRcHcrhFESaIl9Dy5GS2srhktrK4\"/><figcaption>林盛斌攜同太太黃乙頤、長女林霏兒（左一）、次女林熹兒（左三）、三女林機兒（左二）及幼子林道申一同在《史迪仔》首映上接受傳媒訪問。（莫匡堯　攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林盛斌長女林霏兒。（莫匡堯　攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260530/1137407790873186304854137.jpeg/u6sqE_4_OxglYsqmlPcuOf41fcil5D7pPC8kbTwvJG0\"/><figcaption>林盛斌長女林霏兒。（莫匡堯　攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林盛斌與18歲大女兒林霏兒。（IG@bob_lamshingbun）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260530/1137407795201970176981306.jpeg/RB0YRQCqoz8TcAMoaZPC2igrlLn1xiygEKBmeBCgZng\"/><figcaption>林盛斌與18歲大女兒林霏兒。（IG@bob_lamshingbun）</figcaption></figure><p>林霏兒Deep V喱士短裙接廣告 再挑戰性感尺度</p><p>林霏兒日前在Instagram分享一段拍廣告的影片。林霏兒再以性感打扮現身，穿上粉紅色Deep V喱士短裙，穿上細跟高踭鞋，展現甜美可人的一面。林霏兒擺出不同Pose，又跪又坐，富有曲線美。另一個造型則是背心上衣和牛仔褲，一樣青春活力。林霏兒毫不畏懼鏡頭，並發文稱全然擁抱自己：「embrace every part of yourself x」。</p><figure><img alt=\"Bob 18歲大女着Deep V短裙。（IG@fayelammm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260708/1151574829166759936391704.png/xLiHAEexv6oPKzSDEQ2zLvvOh4OKQcZpp7Hp7aex6e0\"/><figcaption>Bob 18歲大女着Deep V短裙。（IG@fayelammm）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"性感！（IG@fayelammm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260708/1151574826582937600846913.png/QkBAgzARHydwqNuSHuLsBC9_ghFxI-DbYT9fKGE_Xyg\"/><figcaption>性感！（IG@fayelammm）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"另一個造型。（IG@fayelammm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260708/1151574823869091840160437.png/spiiN9sH_1zXR5IMELf8Ir8DYO6VupvF7yFh1e8hYdU\"/><figcaption>另一個造型。（IG@fayelammm）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"自信！（IG@fayelammm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260708/1151574836674826240708453.png/8pzhgpB91G_CN5-bsfHgv2VchK021BBulUpk-JVKZPg\"/><figcaption>自信！（IG@fayelammm）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"青春。（IG@fayelammm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260708/1151574834195861504532691.png/WzCEoHOb_7dpzLzAOsuYEm0ImGwb-UDtF4oxeheKMXo\"/><figcaption>青春。（IG@fayelammm）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林霏兒不怕鏡頭。（IG@fayelammm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260708/1151574831540736000021743.png/hyRX-AFJt_gnTnNgBPnqsKHWg3-RvOVkpFxsV6RcbFc\"/><figcaption>林霏兒不怕鏡頭。（IG@fayelammm）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林霏兒不怕鏡頭。（IG@fayelammm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260708/1151574829015633920731092.png/wMBKlLAb8_Y-N98L5Gs5lPi1mKQw_GBxUJbW4VCW1uE\"/><figcaption>林霏兒不怕鏡頭。（IG@fayelammm）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林霏兒發文稱全然擁抱自己。（IG@fayelammm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260708/1151574826633138176291630.png/VzdhGddRN390-QSINv-hQOUsnoW8EnEZO9u7rTvbu60\"/><figcaption>林霏兒發文稱全然擁抱自己。（IG@fayelammm）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-09T03:18:40.945274+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":666,"images":11,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}